      {
        "id": 134118,
        "name": "Donner",
        "username": "Donner",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/{size}/1903_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-27T18:13:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't understand why you view this as being a mess. &nbsp;For me, it is easier to say \"Oh, these guys have the highest health so we need to hit them\" than to go \"This one has the highest. &nbsp;Recalculate. &nbsp;This one has the highest. &nbsp; Recalculate...\"</p><p>The rule is different, sure. but the level of complexity is now at the rule level instead of the play level. &nbsp;And it is easier to deal with there.</p>",
