        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"AlexxKay\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> AlexxKay:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;Conversely, just checking whether the text includes the phrase \"up to\" is simple and easy.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Checking to see if the phrase says highest/lowest/most is not equally easy?</p>",
